&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer, Enterprise Security, you&#39;ll help define and build the security capabilities that allow the world&#39;s most security-conscious organizations to adopt Warp and agentic software development. You&#39;ll work as a product engineer—designing and shipping capabilities across identity, authorization, agent permissions, auditability, data protection, and enterprise controls—while bringing deep security expertise to the decisions we make about the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on software engineering role. You&#39;ll work directly in the Warp codebase, own major technical areas end-to-end, and partner closely with Product and GTM to understand what sophisticated enterprises need from Warp and turn those needs into great product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
